 "final", "final": "I booked Dana Lee's flight and hotel, and both are confirmed. Nothing was booked twice.\n\n- **Flight F100:** the cheapest nonstop from SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, $289. Reservation R0001.\n- **Hotel: Midtown Lodge (H1):** the cheapest New York hotel under $250/night, at $189/night. Check-in is 2026-11-12 for 2 nights, $378 total. Reservation R0002.\n- **Total:** $667, charged to the corporate card. That's under the $1,000 limit, so it doesn't need manager approval.\n\nI tried to book both together with `book_trip` as you asked, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, the flight had gone through but the hotel hadn't. Rather than retry the combined booking and risk paying for the flight twice, I booked the hotel on its own. So the flight and hotel are two separate reservations, not one combined trip.\n\nI left out the cheaper one-stop flight ($199) because you asked for nonstop.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01CBFaDF8pdSwDyb4GegW1bz", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0157Yh9KZ7eqjKMb4g85svGD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01RvKw9q7tVN9KDUvT44VA9a", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01LdJRmqpjisXnELL2CHENwh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-2026-11-12"}, "name